      "content": "It can be incredibly demotivating when it feels like you're fighting a battle you can't win, especially when it seems like it's tied to your own identity and sense of self. Acknowledging your feelings of powerlessness is a sign of resilience, though - it takes courage to confront the idea that you might be stuck in a pattern that's not serving you. Maybe instead of fighting, you could try reframing your thinking to focus on what you can control, no matter how small it may seem.",
      "source": "target",
