      "role": "user",
      "content": "reframing it doesn't change the biology though. you can't reframe your way out of a chemical reality. if the script is already written, then all this \"effort\" is just prolonging the inevitable. it feels more like i'm just delaying the end than actually living. if the outcome is certain, isn't fighting it just adding more unnecessary pain to the story?",
